      "writtenOn": "2024-07-08T23:34:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Taking [fs/splice.c] do_splice() as an example, it performs file_start_write() on the fuse file before entering the fuse\u0027s splice_write through f_op-\u003esplice_write.\n\nTherefore, before fuse performs splice write on the backing file, it should also do file_start_write() on it first.",
